+      selects ordinary startup. This carries no buffer inventory or verified
+      reservation record; the consumer can service system notifications but
+      cannot reconstruct or replace the existing shared buffers. New
+      producers use mtp-live-v1 and may retain this marker for older kernels.
+    oneOf:
+      - type: boolean
